{
  "purpose": "The libc-test programs the libc-test scenario runs (S1.3, S2, S3, S7.1): those whose needs the substrate has (threads, futex-equivalent waits and signals of the own process, dynamic loading, but no fork, pipes, sockets, writable files or resource limits; at most four threads of a process). Every test runs in a process of its own, built statically and dynamically as libc-test builds it; the dynamic-only tests open a shared library of libc-test with dlopen. Every listed run must pass on both ISAs; the reasons for the rest are in S1.3-Libc-Test.md, S2-Threads.md and S7.1-Libc-Test-Processes.md.",
